</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib71.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Conference on Learning Theory</em>, pages 1126–1166. PMLR, 2022.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib72" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">[72]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Xiyang Liu, Prateek Jain, Weihao Kong, Sewoong Oh, and Arun Suggala.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Label robust and differentially private linear regression: Computational and statistical efficiency.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib72.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems</em>, 36:23019–23033, 2023c.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib73" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">[73]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Prashanti Anderson, Ainesh Bakshi, Mahbod Majid, and Stefan Tiegel.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Sample-optimal private regression in polynomial time.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib73.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2503.24321</em>, 2025.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib74" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">[74]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Dylan J Foster, Sham M Kakade, Jian Qian, and Alexander Rakhlin.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">The statistical complexity of interactive decision making.

</span>
